// Modifications: usize→u64; assert_eq → nonzero return. A LITERAL pattern inside an
//   enum-variant payload (`FooUint(1u64)`) is silently NOT tested in Logos (see B145
//   gap), so the discriminating arms use the variant-tag + char-range only
